<title>USA: U S West names Allan Spies as CFO.</title>
<headline>U S West names Allan Spies as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U S West Communications Group said on Monday that it has named Allan Spies as the company's new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Spies has been serving as acting chief financial officer since August, the company said. Spies has been with the company for 26 years and has served as vice president of finance and controller, U S West said.</p>
</text>
